# Keys for the development server (start.ps1), which shouldn't be committed. Optional: without
# this file the development chat works, just without what these keys switch on.
# Copy this file to dev-secrets.env and fill in your own values. dev-secrets.env is never committed
# (it's in .gitignore). start.ps1 reads it on top of dev.env, which has the rest of the settings.

# GIF search (the GIF button by the text box), through GIPHY: a free key from developers.giphy.com,
# "Create an App" -> API (README, "Optional: GIF search"). Empty: the GIF button says it isn't set up.
GIPHY_API_KEY=
